@DocIntel.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5151

### Health: full readiness report (MongoDB, Ollama, vector store)
GET {{DocIntel.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Health: liveness only (no dependency checks)
GET {{DocIntel.Api_HostAddress}}/health/live

###

### Ingest a plain-text document
POST {{DocIntel.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ingest
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./sample.txt
--boundary--

###

### List ingested documents in MongoDB
GET {{DocIntel.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents
Accept: application/json

###

### Ask a question
POST {{DocIntel.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is this document about?"
}

###
